## 🛠️ System Architecture & Resources

### Hardware & Technical Assets
* **UAV Platform:** VTOL (Vertical Take-off and Landing) Hybrid Fixed-Wing UAV (e.g., YF14E-PNP)[cite: 7, 11].
* **Sensors:** Dual RGB Gimbal & Thermal Camera Gimbal[cite: 7, 11].
* **Navigation & Positioning:** RTK-GPS Base Station & Navigation LiDAR module[cite: 7, 11].
* **Ground Support:** Smart Battery Charger, Field Power Unit, and Telemetry Link[cite: 7, 11].

### Software & Analytics
* **Flight Planning:** Automated mission planning and ground control software[cite: 7].
* **AI/ML Frameworks:** PyTorch / TensorFlow for target detection and vegetation indexing[cite: 7, 10].
* **GIS Mapping Platform:** QGIS / Web-GIS Dashboard[cite: 7].

