## ⚠️ Key Risk Register & Mitigation Strategy

| Category | Risk Description | Mitigation Strategy |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Regulatory** | Delays in securing CAAB drone flight permits[cite: 12]. | Early application submission to CAAB ahead of flight schedules[cite: 12]. |
| **Operational** | Adverse weather disrupting flight operations[cite: 12]. | Schedule operations during dry season with allocated contingency buffers[cite: 12]. |
| **Technical** | AI model misclassification or false negatives[cite: 12]. | Secondary review by human domain experts for verification[cite: 12]. |
| **Technical** | UAV battery exhaustion mid-flight[cite: 12]. | Deploy energy-efficient VTOL airframe and set multi-point charging stations[cite: 12]. |
| **Security** | Data breach or unauthorized grid map leakage[cite: 12]. | File encryption and compliance with PGCB cybersecurity guidelines[cite: 12]. |

